            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/389460/extras/0202afbeba0556d114e370c2b82c4d9b.avif?t=1790989033\" width=1210 height=417 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robot vs. Birds Zumbies depicts the spread of avian influenza virus through the infected dead birds that turned into zombies, a robot is built by survivors to eliminate that threat, your mission is to control the robot to remove the birds and prevent zombies proliferation of the virus. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must solve various puzzles to eliminate them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various weapons and mechanics with many puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 60 levels</p>",
